## .NET secrets & environment
infra/.env
infra/**/.env
infra/realms/MyStackOverflow-realm.json
# Generated by `aspire publish`/`aspire deploy`. .env.Production is filled in
# with the resolved parameter values - real secrets - so none of it belongs in
# git. The compose file the project actually uses is published to infra/.
MyStackOverflow.AppHost/aspire-output/
# Self-signed TLS material for the local deployment. The private keys must never
# be committed; infra/certs/openssl.cnf stays tracked so they can be regenerated.
infra/certs/*.key
infra/certs/*.crt
infra/.env.Production
infra/**/.env.Production
secrets.json
**/secrets.json

